So it was a lot of time saving.

56
00:03:22,420 --> 00:03:24,340
Anyway, today's first email.

57
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:25,340
A condition in marriage.

58
00:03:25,420 --> 00:03:29,340
Asalam Junaid Bhai, hope you're doing well. I want to marry a girl who wants to do a job.

59
00:03:29,420 --> 00:03:33,340
But I don't want her to do a job in men working environment.

60
00:03:33,420 --> 00:03:40,340
And instead I want her to do the business because I am myself, I am from a business background and well of family.

61
00:03:40,420 --> 00:03:42,250
Therefore I can provide each and every luxury.

62
00:03:42,330 --> 00:03:44,327
and can give her the best of the life.

63
00:03:44,407 --> 00:03:49,238
I know it's her basic right, but I'm no one to stop her from doing a job.

64
00:03:49,318 --> 00:03:50,769
But how do I change my mind?

65
00:03:50,849 --> 00:03:56,474
I always get convinced by your opinion, so I want you to please tell me what should I do.

66
00:03:56,554 --> 00:03:57,319
Secondly, yes,

67
00:03:57,399 --> 00:04:03,329
I don't want her to work in a men working environment because I think when I'm here working for both of us,

68
00:04:03,409 --> 00:04:07,950
then why she needs to go on a job and work between men when we are living a good life.

69
00:04:08,030 --> 00:04:14,670
And plus if she does a job, her working hours might not be flexible, but in business they can be.

70
00:04:14,750 --> 00:04:22,619
Therefore, if I want to take her on lunch and I can't because she's on job,

71
00:04:22,699 --> 00:04:24,670
I just don't want this.

72
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:28,390
After all, a person earns for his wife and children.

73
00:04:28,470 --> 00:04:32,590
However, if she's working online with flexible hours or a part-time job, I'm good with it.

74
00:04:32,670 --> 00:04:33,990
I didn't understand the question.

75
00:04:34,250 --> 00:04:40,170
See, it's very simple. You marry the type of woman you want.

76
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:45,170
You said that men are not allowed to work in working environment, but you can do business.

77
00:04:45,250 --> 00:04:48,170
So, business is not done by men, not by aliens.

78
00:04:48,250 --> 00:04:53,893
You should think that without men or women, you will get a world, filtered,

79
00:04:53,973 --> 00:04:59,250
where you can do everything and you will not have to deal with anyone.

80
00:05:00,040 --> 00:05:01,960
A person sets his own boundaries.

81
00:05:02,040 --> 00:05:08,517
Now if your boundaries are set and if you're stern, then you can work with a thousand men,

82
00:05:08,597 --> 00:05:10,960
who would dare to do anything to anyone.

83
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:17,493
But if you don't put people on their place, then even if there is one,

84
00:05:17,573 --> 00:05:20,960
that's enough to do the damage.

85
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:27,040
The second thing is that, brother, look, what you said that I can provide.

86
00:05:27,510 --> 00:05:31,770
So, they don't have to provide for them.

87
00:05:31,850 --> 00:05:40,230
The purpose won't be that some people have the thought that we have studied so much and everyone wants to be self-sufficient and why not?

88
00:05:40,310 --> 00:05:44,390
I tell everyone to keep their work and their financial freedom in their hands.

89
00:05:44,470 --> 00:05:46,230
So, obviously, they will have the same desires.

90
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:48,230
Let them have some contribution, whatever it is.

91
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:53,430
Now you said you are from a well-off business family.

92
00:05:53,890 --> 00:05:57,890
But then she feels like she doesn't have a contribution.

93
00:05:58,510 --> 00:06:05,061
You will find many people who want to sit at home, get ready, go to brunch with friends,

94
00:06:05,141 --> 00:06:10,810
put big bags on the table and click selfies and badmouth their husbands.

95
00:06:10,890 --> 00:06:13,502
You will find many people like this.

96
00:06:13,582 --> 00:06:18,530
So if you don't want a working woman, don't look for her.

97
00:06:20,910 --> 00:06:25,652
If a girl says that she wants her husband to wear a hijab,

98
00:06:25,732 --> 00:06:29,750
then she can do it with any girl of any religion.

99
00:06:29,830 --> 00:06:33,590
If she is already wearing a hijab or burqa or covers it.

100
00:06:33,670 --> 00:06:35,990
So you can't have your cake and eat it.

101
00:06:36,070 --> 00:06:41,350
So I don't understand that I want this type of girl and now I have to change her.

102
00:06:41,430 --> 00:06:43,830
And I am doing all this. Don't do this.

103
00:06:43,910 --> 00:06:47,110
You will get a lot who would be very happy.

104
00:06:47,710 --> 00:06:53,870
They sit at home all day, order things from the maids, and they also shop online.

105
00:06:53,950 --> 00:06:58,270
There are shopping groups, right?

106
00:06:58,350 --> 00:07:00,270
Any item comes, there's a comment below, PP.

107
00:07:00,350 --> 00:07:02,270
Price, please.

108
00:07:02,350 --> 00:07:04,790
She'll keep on saying PP all day, okay?

109
00:07:04,870 --> 00:07:08,390
Then you'll come home with the PP, understand?

110
00:07:08,470 --> 00:07:12,150
So, you find a woman like that, who you don't want to get a job from.

111
00:07:12,230 --> 00:07:14,230
It's important to catch someone and change them.

112
00:07:14,970 --> 00:07:20,250
If you are interested in changing yourself, then do it yourself.

113
00:07:20,330 --> 00:07:24,850
If you can't, then don't go for a person who wants to do a job.

114
00:07:24,930 --> 00:07:31,690
And if you have to take your wife for lunch, I don't know what husbands are like that think about taking their wife for lunch.

115
00:07:31,770 --> 00:07:33,690
Leave work and go for lunch.

116
00:07:33,770 --> 00:07:35,690
Go, go, enjoy.

117
00:07:35,770 --> 00:07:39,770
But this is a direct advice.

118
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:43,260
Find someone who is right for you.

119
00:07:43,340 --> 00:07:46,340
No one needs to be beaten up.

120
00:07:49,280 --> 00:07:51,860
family is a curse we are forced to respect.

121
00:07:51,940 --> 00:07:57,280
Jai Hind Bhai, please don't mention my name as my family is a frequent viewer and they won't tolerate it.

122
00:07:57,700 --> 00:08:01,540
I'm a big fan, always watch your videos to get some motivation out of it.

123
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:05,860
You're a really inspiring character to me. Keep up the good work. Thank you.

124
00:08:07,740 --> 00:08:08,040
and anxiety which I am holding up.

125
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:11,231
and anxiety which I'm holding up since many years now.

126
00:08:11,311 --> 00:08:13,427
I'm 22 living in Karachi.

127
00:08:13,507 --> 00:08:16,750
I've always been interested into business and entrepreneurship.

128
00:08:16,830 --> 00:08:18,136
Also succeed in my in few.

129
00:08:18,216 --> 00:08:22,290
My life is full of miserable experiences and worst case scenarios.

130
00:08:22,370 --> 00:08:23,093
When I was five,

131
00:08:23,173 --> 00:08:26,969
my blood brother sexually harassed me and I was victimized more than once.

132
00:08:27,049 --> 00:08:29,459
The incident when came to my mother's knowledge,

133
00:08:29,539 --> 00:08:34,580
she never took any action because she thought my father would kill my elder brother and she looked

134
00:08:34,660 --> 00:08:37,073
she lose the eldest child of the family.

135
00:08:37,153 --> 00:08:38,946
I had to stay quiet on that case.

136
00:08:39,026 --> 00:08:41,797
My parents didn't have a very healthy relationship.

137
00:08:41,877 --> 00:08:45,868
My father used to drink and abuse my mother and she also remained quiet.

138
00:08:45,948 --> 00:08:51,700
Another brother who was living in the same circumstances attempted suicide at teenage.

139
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:54,986
I experienced all of this at a very early stage of my life.

140
00:08:55,066 --> 00:08:57,348
This all experiences led me to depression.

141
00:08:57,428 --> 00:09:00,333
However, I tried to go overcome and focus on career.

142
00:09:00,413 --> 00:09:02,320
I tried many times to focus on study, but

143
00:09:02,400 --> 00:09:08,680
but always failed. Even I failed my O levels twice and passed all the subjects at the third attempt.

144
00:09:08,760 --> 00:09:14,600
While I was failing in studies, I managed to get a job and study myself as it could be more motivational.

145
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:19,960
At sixteen I got a job from a private company for sales and I really succeeded in sales department.

146
00:09:20,040 --> 00:09:24,680
At eighteen I was earning around one lakh average. Very good.

147
00:09:24,760 --> 00:09:29,480
I used to play video games professionally and earn money from it when it wasn't common in Pakistan.

148
00:09:30,790 --> 00:09:34,934
I had enormous dreams, decided to have my own business and succeed with that.

149
00:09:35,014 --> 00:09:40,844
At twenty, I didn't want to study anymore because I already made assets.

150
00:09:40,924 --> 00:09:43,668
I thought I have much potential to achieve the mark.

151
00:09:43,748 --> 00:09:45,859
However, in lockdown, the tables turned.

152
00:09:45,939 --> 00:09:50,184
I couldn't go out and I used to see my parents fight every day.

153
00:09:50,264 --> 00:09:53,988
The brother who harassed me was abusing his wife every day.

154
00:09:54,068 --> 00:09:56,470
My home was a chaos which I couldn't handle.

155
00:09:57,100 --> 00:10:00,838
I literally locked myself in a room, smoking cigarettes every day,

156
00:10:00,918 --> 00:10:04,760
thinking about suicide because I couldn't handle the environment.

157
00:10:05,100 --> 00:10:12,020
Four to six months from lockdown, I was so demotivated and afraid of any type of human interaction that I attempted suicide.

158
00:10:12,100 --> 00:10:18,020
All the thoughts were approaching my mind and again and again, it was nearly impossible to ignore.

159
00:10:18,100 --> 00:10:22,820
I don't know how I lived at that time. Maybe Allah may have planned something for me.

160
00:10:22,900 --> 00:10:25,040
With the hope of Allah, I survived the lockdown.

161
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:28,886
and when I came back into earning money, I couldn't perform in anything.

162
00:10:28,966 --> 00:10:33,972
I tried so hard to do something, but anything I do, I couldn't stay consistent in it.

163
00:10:34,052 --> 00:10:37,243
I used to work, but somehow fell low and locked myself again.

164
00:10:37,323 --> 00:10:39,498
It's been two years now.

165
00:10:39,578 --> 00:10:41,095
I think I'm totally finished.

166
00:10:41,175 --> 00:10:42,849
My life is over because of this.

167
00:10:42,929 --> 00:10:45,729
I read a book where it stated that to be successful,

168
00:10:45,809 --> 00:10:49,707
you have to take responsibility of your own life and don't blame someone.

169
00:10:49,787 --> 00:10:50,870
But I don't understand.

170
00:10:50,950 --> 00:10:52,868
don't understand how can I do this?

171
00:10:52,948 --> 00:10:57,653
Life seems so finished at this point that I don't know whether to live or to die.

172
00:10:57,733 --> 00:11:01,410
It feels like all my goals, vision, objective of life are dead.

173
00:11:01,490 --> 00:11:02,803
I'm just a human alive.

174
00:11:02,883 --> 00:11:09,095
I consulted a psychologist and the advice was useless to me as I couldn't stay consistent in anything now.

175
00:11:09,175 --> 00:11:12,338
I really need a brotherly advice from you, Junid Bhai.

176
00:11:12,418 --> 00:11:14,565
I want to make myself productive again.

177
00:11:14,645 --> 00:11:15,673
I'm just hopeless.

178
00:11:15,753 --> 00:11:18,910
I would really feel appreciate I would really appreciate

179
00:11:18,990 --> 00:11:22,620
Thank you so much for this email.

180
00:11:22,700 --> 00:11:32,150
You're 22 living in Karachi and you were earning 1 lakh in 2018.

181
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:35,790
So clearly you have the knack of earning.

182
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:42,080
of making money. Which is great.

183
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:45,120
Many people don't even reach the age of 30.

184
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:48,480
So you're already way ahead of a lot of people.

185
00:11:48,560 --> 00:11:50,720
I mean, imagine we live in a city of 3 crores.

186
00:11:50,800 --> 00:11:54,160
How many 18 year old kids are earning less than 1 lakh.

187
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:58,720
Just go to any tea shop at night and see those people playing Ludo or Skechers.

188
00:11:58,800 --> 00:12:00,400
Nothing against those games.

189
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:04,640
But just like, you feel the vibe of a table.

190
00:12:05,170 --> 00:12:09,890
You sit at a hotel, you look at the table and you get the vibe of what's going on.

191
00:12:09,970 --> 00:12:15,570
So I see this every day. Very uninspiring people all around.

192
00:12:15,650 --> 00:12:20,950
So you're good at that. What you need is focus.

193
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:25,710
Lockdown has ruined a lot of things. I'm not going to deny that.

194
00:12:25,790 --> 00:12:31,770
It could be relationships, marriages, it could be friendships, it could be work ethic.

195
00:12:32,540 --> 00:12:35,460
People who are going back to the workforce,

196
00:12:35,540 --> 00:12:38,460
earlier work from home was difficult,

197
00:12:38,540 --> 00:12:41,460
but some people, especially people who are introverts,

198
00:12:41,540 --> 00:12:44,460
they were really happy working from home.

199
00:12:44,540 --> 00:12:47,460
Now that the offices are calling them back because

200
00:12:47,540 --> 00:12:51,460
the world is run by real estate companies and real estate companies were drowning because

201
00:12:51,540 --> 00:12:55,460
who will take office in such big buildings in Manhattan or in Shariah Faisal?

202
00:12:55,540 --> 00:12:59,460
If everyone does work from home, then real estate will crash.

203
00:12:59,540 --> 00:13:00,540
You get what I'm saying?

204
00:13:01,320 --> 00:13:02,880
So now they are calling people back.

205
00:13:02,960 --> 00:13:06,720
Or people are finding it difficult, really difficult.

206
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:12,272
So lockdown, I mean of all the people in the world, and of all the times,

207
00:13:12,352 --> 00:13:15,280
we were the generation that had to face it.

208
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:17,612
I don't even remember the lockdown.

209
00:13:17,692 --> 00:13:23,160
And for me it was very very difficult as well because I had, literally had a baby.

210
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:29,120
And then I was not accustomed to an environment where I have to raise a child.

211
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:34,880
and then that too in a lockdown in a small house, that too away from Pakistan.

212
00:13:34,960 --> 00:13:38,691
And to smoke a cigarette, you have to open the door.

213
00:13:38,771 --> 00:13:42,574
Because I have a rule, I had a rule, now I don't smoke,

214
00:13:42,654 --> 00:13:46,680
that I won't smoke at home so that the kids don't have a negative impact.

215
00:13:46,760 --> 00:13:52,200
I didn't want them to be comfortable that yes, if two are coming, then it's okay. Because then they will also pick up.

216
00:13:52,280 --> 00:13:57,280
Because I have a very good friend, his father used to make him smoke.

217
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:08,840
It was a very difficult time. Lockdown indeed really messed us up.

218
00:14:08,920 --> 00:14:13,840
A lot of things were irreparable but then nothing is impossible.

219
00:14:13,920 --> 00:14:17,840
A lot of things became irreparable. For example, relationships.

220
00:14:17,920 --> 00:14:22,840
A lot of people got to know each other a little more.

221
00:14:22,920 --> 00:14:28,840
Otherwise, you are not at home for 8-10 hours, so you can't experience the next day.

222
00:14:28,920 --> 00:14:30,650
Or you can't experience them.

223
00:14:30,850 --> 00:14:32,770
For better or worse.

224
00:14:33,370 --> 00:14:34,370
So.

225
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:37,670
What you need now is focus.

226
00:14:38,610 --> 00:14:44,688
I always say that the things that are circumstantial, like read upon stoicism,

227
00:14:44,768 --> 00:14:47,770
there is a lot of material on YouTube.

228
00:14:48,010 --> 00:14:50,570
Marcus Aurelius and all these things.

229
00:14:50,710 --> 00:14:56,510
It has helped me a lot. I would be very honest.

230
00:14:57,780 --> 00:15:03,706
You know what happens, the circumstantial things or problems that come up,

231
00:15:03,786 --> 00:15:09,000
it's very easy to deal with them because it wasn't your doing.

